// MOVED from the Playground to Boyle Ext (round 8): the original Playground has no navmesh, so the
// guards never walked to the shot there. Placement: the quiet flat navmesh diagonal of the south-west
// yard (floor z -1317, direction 112.5 deg; `oracle navlines`), the shooter at (-8155, -9576) and the
// six guards 500 .. 3000 uu ahead in steps of 500 (the longest clean line is 3450 uu: the row was 600 ..
// 3600 in steps of 600 on the Playground, so the guards are renamed g500 .. g3000 and the row is 600 uu shorter;
// the Quiet audio split at 2000 uu still falls between g1500 and g2000).
// Bark arbitration by fire group and distance (conversation.md findings 4-9). Six hostile guards
// stand in a row down the Playground stealth lane at 600 .. 3600 uu from the player, all facing
// away. One pistol shot (Danger noise) is heard by every guard; the near ones also see the player,
// so the room goes through notice / search / combat barks within seconds. Barks of one fire group
// compete: the original queues the requests per group and per Loud / Quiet audio distance (2000 uu)
// and fires the best weight first (weight = 1 - d / 5000 + rand * 0.2, DisConvGlobalMan tick
// 0x00ca5b20, weights 0x00ca2580); the rest are dropped for that tick, the group allows 1 (Threat,
// Agitated) or 2 (Combat cries, Attention) at once per queue (a bark from a speaker whose audio path
// is 2000 uu or more away is in the separate Quiet queue, so one Loud and one Quiet bark of a group
// may play together) and locks for its minimum spacing when a bark ends.
// The port fires requests in asking order and rejects the others by the group cap.
// Observables: the order and tick of the AkEvent posts per guard, the number of posts per window,
// and that no two barks of a 1-slot group overlap.
(
    name: "conversation/bark_group_arbitration",
    system: Conversation,
    map: "L_Boyle_Ext_P",
    description: "Six guards react to one shot at 500..3000 uu: which barks play, in what order, how many at once.",
    setup: (
        player: Some((position: (-8155, -9576, -1221), yaw: 112.5, pitch: 60, snap_to_floor: true)),
        items: ["Bullet:5"],
        left_hand: Some("Pistol"),
        npcs: [
            (id: Some("g500"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-8346.3, -9114.1, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
            (id: Some("g1000"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-8537.7, -8652.1, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
            (id: Some("g1500"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-8729.0, -8190.2, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
            (id: Some("g2000"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-8920.4, -7728.2, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
            (id: Some("g2500"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-9111.7, -7266.3, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
            (id: Some("g3000"), tweak: Some("Twk_Pawn_Boyle_Party.Pwn_EliteGuard_MTall_2_Doorman"), position: Some((-9303.0, -6804.4, -1217)), yaw: 112.5, state: Some("Idle"), faction: Some("DisFaction_Defaults.Faction_Guard_Default")),
        ],
        settle: 120,
    ),
